{
  "_note": "首页:一家公司 × 一个类型分段的最近 10–20 份(生成器 tools/infosource/gen_secfilings.py)。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tRaw",
        "value": "${t}"
      },
      "_note": "入参落地(勿删)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tIn",
        "value": "$[toUpperCase::(findNotEmpty::(${tRaw},))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "reAmp",
        "value": "&amp;"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rpAmp",
        "value": "&"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "kRaw",
        "value": "${kind}"
      },
      "_note": "入参落地(勿删):方法参数里的 ${} 看不见 flow 入参。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "kIn",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${kRaw},all)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "qty",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${kIn},cur),8-K,if::(eq::(${kIn},fin),10-,))]"
      },
      "_note": "type 是**前缀**:8-K 含 8-K/A,10- 含 10-Q / 10-K 及更正。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "qow",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${kIn},ins),only,exclude)]"
      },
      "_note": "内部人走 owner=only(Form 3/4/5 与 144)。⚠️ 不能用 type=4:前缀会把 424B2 一并带出。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "kd",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${kIn},cur),2,if::(eq::(${kIn},fin),3,if::(eq::(${kIn},ins),4,1)))]"
      },
      "_note": "类型码(1 全部 / 2 8-K / 3 财报 / 4 内部人),给 RCN 选卡名用。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "qcn",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${kIn},all),20,10)]"
      },
      "_note": "「全部」多取一些(20 份):大公司的 13G / S-8 / N-PX 不少,10 份常常只覆盖几周。其余类型 10 份(SEC 下限)。"
    },
    {
      "_note": "入参必须先 op:set 落地成 data 域的键,方法参数里才看得见(§9.5 #3)。`.xwidget` 不传 → 空串 → 归 0 → 全程不碰缓存。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cacheIn",
        "value": "${_cache}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "useCache",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${cacheIn},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "**结构版本号**:pack 的字段集变了就 +1。它管的不是「数据新不新」而是「这份数据的**形状**还认不认」——缓存键只含对象维度、不含包代际,不盖这个戳,升级后首屏就会拿上一版的 pack 去渲新模板:少的字段取空,尺寸串里的 calc 一算 null,**整卡白块且不报错**。\n⚠️ 从 1 起、绝不能用 0(`eq::(空,0)` 恒为 true,旧缓存会被判成匹配)。⚠️ 刻意不用 `manifest.version`:flow 拿不到,且那会过度失效(只改配色也丢全部缓存)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "SCHEMA",
        "value": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "缓存键。⚠️ 凡是影响结果的入参都要进键,且**绝不能用下标**(下标随增删漂移,漂移后会把 A 的数据渲成 B 的,还不报错)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ckey",
        "value": "$[connect::(c.sec.,${tIn},.,${kIn})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "读缓存。`default:{}` 让下面的 ${hit.ts} 在无缓存时安全取空,而不是整条流断掉。",
      "id": "hit",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${ckey}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hitSchema",
        "value": "${hit.schema}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowMs",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hitTs",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${hit.ts},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "age",
        "value": "$[calc::(${nowMs}-${hitTs})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "两道闸:**结构比对**(pack 形状对不上就当没有缓存 —— 旧形状渲新模板是白块,比等一次网络糟得多)+ hardTTL = 172800s(太旧的数先渲出来再改口,不如老实等一次)。嵌套 if 而不是 and:: —— `and` 不在确认可用的方法集里。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hasHit",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${hitSchema},${SCHEMA}),if::(gt::(${hitTs},0),if::(lt::(${age},172800000),1,0),0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "ttl = 300s(§5.5.3)。纯新鲜度,不掺 useCache —— 掺进去 `_stale` 就算不对了。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "fresh",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${hitTs},0),if::(lt::(${age},300000),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "「这次先出的是旧货,请后台校新」。**必须进 resultFilter** —— 校新那条路靠它,漏了就是永不校新。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_stale",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${useCache},1),if::(eq::(${hasHit},1),if::(eq::(${fresh},1),0,1),0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "只有「开了缓存 且 有没超 hardTTL 的货」才跳过网络 —— 连接都不建立。⚠️ **stale 也走这条跳过**(首屏零等待是三态的全部价值);写成「不 fresh 就打」= 退回两态,首屏照样白等。卡片(useCache=0)与冷启一律落进 items 真取数。",
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${useCache},1),if::(eq::(${hasHit},1),0,1),1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "request",
          "id": "raw",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=${tIn}&type=${qty}&dateb=&owner=${qow}&count=${qcn}&output=atom",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "string",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable support@numable.app",
              "Accept": "application/atom+xml"
            },
            "timeout": "12000"
          },
          "_note": "formatType:string —— Atom XML 不经任何 XML 解析器,用 split 切(xmlParse 四端是四个引擎,对带默认 xmlns 的 Atom 结果互相矛盾;memory actionflow-df-pitfalls §xmlparse)。UA 是 SEC 要求的如实身份,不是伪装(见生成器头注)。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_b",
            "value": "1"
          },
          "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "SP",
            "value": "$[split::(${raw},<entry>)]"
          },
          "_note": "按 <entry> 切一次成数组(第 0 段是 feed 头)。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "nm",
            "value": "$[replaceAll::(index::(split::(index::(split::(${raw},<conformed-name>),1),<),0),${reAmp},${rpAmp})]"
          },
          "_note": "SEC 登记的公司名(AT&amp;T → AT&T)。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "rows",
            "value": [
              {
                "f": "$[replaceAll::(index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},1),<filing-type>),1),<),0),SCHEDULE,SC)]",
                "d": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},1),<filing-date>),1),<),0)]",
                "u": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},1),<updated>),1),<),0)]",
                "h": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},1),<filing-href>),1),<),0)]",
                "a": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},1),<accession-number>),1),<),0)]",
                "i": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},1),<items-desc>),1),<),0)]",
                "n": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},1),<form-name>),1),<),0)]"
              },
              {
                "f": "$[replaceAll::(index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},2),<filing-type>),1),<),0),SCHEDULE,SC)]",
                "d": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},2),<filing-date>),1),<),0)]",
                "u": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},2),<updated>),1),<),0)]",
                "h": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},2),<filing-href>),1),<),0)]",
                "a": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},2),<accession-number>),1),<),0)]",
                "i": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},2),<items-desc>),1),<),0)]",
                "n": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},2),<form-name>),1),<),0)]"
              },
              {
                "f": "$[replaceAll::(index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},3),<filing-type>),1),<),0),SCHEDULE,SC)]",
                "d": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},3),<filing-date>),1),<),0)]",
                "u": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},3),<updated>),1),<),0)]",
                "h": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},3),<filing-href>),1),<),0)]",
                "a": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},3),<accession-number>),1),<),0)]",
                "i": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},3),<items-desc>),1),<),0)]",
                "n": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},3),<form-name>),1),<),0)]"
              },
              {
                "f": "$[replaceAll::(index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},4),<filing-type>),1),<),0),SCHEDULE,SC)]",
                "d": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},4),<filing-date>),1),<),0)]",
                "u": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},4),<updated>),1),<),0)]",
                "h": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},4),<filing-href>),1),<),0)]",
                "a": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},4),<accession-number>),1),<),0)]",
                "i": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},4),<items-desc>),1),<),0)]",
                "n": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},4),<form-name>),1),<),0)]"
              },
              {
                "f": "$[replaceAll::(index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},5),<filing-type>),1),<),0),SCHEDULE,SC)]",
                "d": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},5),<filing-date>),1),<),0)]",
                "u": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},5),<updated>),1),<),0)]",
                "h": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},5),<filing-href>),1),<),0)]",
                "a": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},5),<accession-number>),1),<),0)]",
                "i": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},5),<items-desc>),1),<),0)]",
                "n": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},5),<form-name>),1),<),0)]"
              },
              {
                "f": "$[replaceAll::(index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},6),<filing-type>),1),<),0),SCHEDULE,SC)]",
                "d": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},6),<filing-date>),1),<),0)]",
                "u": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},6),<updated>),1),<),0)]",
                "h": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},6),<filing-href>),1),<),0)]",
                "a": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},6),<accession-number>),1),<),0)]",
                "i": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},6),<items-desc>),1),<),0)]",
                "n": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},6),<form-name>),1),<),0)]"
              },
              {
                "f": "$[replaceAll::(index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},7),<filing-type>),1),<),0),SCHEDULE,SC)]",
                "d": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},7),<filing-date>),1),<),0)]",
                "u": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},7),<updated>),1),<),0)]",
                "h": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},7),<filing-href>),1),<),0)]",
                "a": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},7),<accession-number>),1),<),0)]",
                "i": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},7),<items-desc>),1),<),0)]",
                "n": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},7),<form-name>),1),<),0)]"
              },
              {
                "f": "$[replaceAll::(index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},8),<filing-type>),1),<),0),SCHEDULE,SC)]",
                "d": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},8),<filing-date>),1),<),0)]",
                "u": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},8),<updated>),1),<),0)]",
                "h": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},8),<filing-href>),1),<),0)]",
                "a": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},8),<accession-number>),1),<),0)]",
                "i": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},8),<items-desc>),1),<),0)]",
                "n": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},8),<form-name>),1),<),0)]"
              },
              {
                "f": "$[replaceAll::(index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},9),<filing-type>),1),<),0),SCHEDULE,SC)]",
                "d": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},9),<filing-date>),1),<),0)]",
                "u": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},9),<updated>),1),<),0)]",
                "h": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},9),<filing-href>),1),<),0)]",
                "a": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},9),<accession-number>),1),<),0)]",
                "i": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},9),<items-desc>),1),<),0)]",
                "n": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},9),<form-name>),1),<),0)]"
              },
              {
                "f": "$[replaceAll::(index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},10),<filing-type>),1),<),0),SCHEDULE,SC)]",
                "d": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},10),<filing-date>),1),<),0)]",
                "u": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},10),<updated>),1),<),0)]",
                "h": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},10),<filing-href>),1),<),0)]",
                "a": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},10),<accession-number>),1),<),0)]",
                "i": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},10),<items-desc>),1),<),0)]",
                "n": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},10),<form-name>),1),<),0)]"
              },
              {
                "f": "$[replaceAll::(index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},11),<filing-type>),1),<),0),SCHEDULE,SC)]",
                "d": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},11),<filing-date>),1),<),0)]",
                "u": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},11),<updated>),1),<),0)]",
                "h": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},11),<filing-href>),1),<),0)]",
                "a": "$[index::(split::(index::(split::(index::(${SP},11),<accession-number>),1),<),0)]",
